Rougarou OS is an independent Debian derivative inspired by Omarchy.
It is not endorsed by Debian, Omarchy, OpenAI, GitHub or Proxmox.

Original integration code in this repository is MIT licensed. This does not
relicense Linux, Debian packages, firmware, Codex or other bundled software.
Debian package notices are installed under /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright.
Codex's upstream license accompanies its bundled binary. Other packaged agent
licenses and notices must accompany their respective artifacts.

The project palette and wolf artwork come from the Rougarou theme,
"The Architect's Grimoire": Bayou Midnight #080F0B, Moonlit Fern #79C58E,
Silver Mist #DFE7DF and Rougarou Green #086B35. The theme's Unicode wolf and
ASCII fallback are retained as project branding. No proprietary model weights
are bundled.

Release images are accompanied by a corresponding-source bundle, source
coverage manifests, upstream notices and verification instructions in
docs/downloads.md. Original upstream archives retain their bytes and authorship;
Rougarou's modifications and build scripts are in the matching release tag.
Redistributors must preserve the notices and meet the obligations of each
component's license. No proprietary model weights or provider credentials
are included.
